      "start_seconds": 320.21,
      "end_seconds": 331.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned but right now severe pre-eclampsia is my leading thought not anything worse let's book a urine protein test to look into pre-eclampsia"
