      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.4,
      "end_seconds": 355.62,
      "duration_seconds": 19.22,
      "text": "I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for pre-eclampsia the result will help us decide whether anything more is needed what I'm giving you is labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now, single dose that should help with severe hypertension"
