      "start_seconds": 362.09,
      "end_seconds": 383.51,
      "duration_seconds": 21.42,
      "text": "you need to go to the maternity unit straight away i think the obstetric team should see you too please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently book a review straight away how would you describe the plan so we're on the same page?"
